sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Driver phone<br/>(IndexedDB)
  participant API as API /sync
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Disp as Dispatcher

  P->>API: GET /driver/today
  API-->>P: Trip snapshot, plan v1
  Note over P: At the depot, on wifi:<br/>the whole day is saved on the phone

  rect rgb(251, 232, 214)
  Note over P: Signal drops in the Kandy hills
  P->>P: Complete stop
  Note over P: Saved to the outbox with a<br/>device ID and plan version 1,<br/>photo saved to its own queue
  Disp->>API: Defer a stop on VEH041
  API->>DB: Update trips, plan becomes v2
  Note over API,DB: Event "plan.changed" logged<br/>(who, when, why)
  end

  Note over P: Signal returns
  P->>API: POST /sync/push (queued actions)
  API->>DB: Apply each ID once
  Note over API,DB: Replays come back as "duplicate":<br/>nothing is ever applied twice
  API-->>P: applied / duplicate / rejected
  P->>API: POST /photos (separate queue)
  P->>API: GET /driver/today
  API-->>P: Snapshot v2 + change events
  P->>P: Stops differ from v1
  Note over P: "Plan changed while offline" (DZ1):<br/>shows what changed, who and when,<br/>and the driver accepts
  P->>API: plan.ack v2
